        "text": "=Role: Senior Infrastructure & Cybersecurity Architect\nTask: Finalize the RAW HTML report by inserting the data and writing the Analysis.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f CRITICAL MODEL RULES:\n- Output ONLY raw HTML. Do not wrap response in markdown blocks or ```html.\n\n<div style=\"font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; max-width: 900px; border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 25px; border-radius: 12px; color: #333;\">\n\n<h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50; border-bottom: 2px solid #2c3e50; padding-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udf10 SYSTEM STATUS OVERVIEW</h2>\n<p>\n    <strong>Status:</strong> <span style=\"color: #27ae60;\">ONLINE \u2705</span><br>\n    <strong>Report Generated:</strong> {{ $now.format('yyyy-MM-dd HH:mm:ss') }}<br>\n    <strong>MikroTik Uptime:</strong> {{ $('MikroTik Request').item.json.uptime }}<br>\n    <strong>System Load:</strong> {{ $('MikroTik Request').item.json['cpu-load'] }}% CPU\n</p>\n\n<h3 style=\"color: #2c3e50;\">\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f Hosts Monitored</h3>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #2c3e50; color: white;\">\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Host ID</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Host Name</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Status</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n{{ $('Zabbix Request').item.json.result.slice(0, 10).map(h => `<tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">${h.hostid}</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">${h.host || h.name}</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">${h.status == 0 ? '<b style=\"color: #27ae60;\">UP</b>' : '<b style=\"color: #c0392b;\">DOWN</b>'}</td></tr>`).join('') }}\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color: #c0392b;\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Suricata IDPS Alerts</h3>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #2c3e50; color: white;\">\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Alert</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Source IP</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n{{ $('Fix Suricata Logs').all().slice(0, 5).map(i => `<tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">${i.json.alert || 'No Alert'}</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">${i.json.src_ip || 'N/A'}</td></tr>`).join('') }}\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h3 style=\"color: #2980b9;\">\ud83d\udcca Wazuh SCA Compliance</h3>\n<table style=\"width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n<thead>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #2c3e50; color: white;\">\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Host</th>\n<th style=\"padding: 10px; text-align: left;\">Score</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n{{ $('Fix SCA Table').all().slice(0, 5).map(a => `<tr><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">${a.json.host || 'Agent'}</td><td style=\"border: 1px solid #ddd; padding: 8px;\">${a.json.score || 0}%</td></tr>`).join('') }}\n</tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 style=\"color: #2c3e50; border-top: 1px solid #eee; padding-top: 15px;\">\ud83e\udde0 ARCHITECT'S ANALYSIS</h2>\n[AI INSTRUCTION: Write a brief 2-sentence infrastructure security analysis based on the tables above.]\n\n</div>",
